These are the binomial coefficients from the 4th row of Pascal's triangle: $ \binom{4}{0}, \binom{4}{1}, \binom{4}{2}, \binom{4}{3}, \binom{4}{4} $.

The structure of the expression is:
$$
(a)^4 - 4(a - 2)^4 + 6(a - 4)^4 - 4(a - 6)^4 + (a - 8)^4
$$
